Bloodlust Cast
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Ability being cast) Equal to ENHANCEMENT_Bloodlust 
    Actions
        -------- ================================================ --------
        Set VariableSet BL_Caster = (Triggering unit)
        Set VariableSet BL_Point = (Position of (Triggering unit))
        Set VariableSet BL_AbilityLevel = (Level of (Ability being cast) for BL_Caster)
        -------- ================================================ --------
        Animation - Play BL_Caster's spell animation
        Animation - Queue BL_Caster's stand animation
        -------- ================================================ --------
        -------- Detect units within range --------
        Set VariableSet BL_TempGroup = (Units within 600.00 of BL_Point matching (((Matching unit) belongs to an ally of (Owner of BL_Caster).) Equal to True).)
        -------- Add also the caster to group --------
        Unit Group - Add BL_Caster to BL_TempGroup
        -------- ================================================ --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                BL_AbilityLevel Equal to 1
            Then - Actions
                -------- == LEVEL 1 == --------
                Unit Group - Pick every unit in BL_TempGroup and do (Actions)
                    Loop - Actions
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                ((Picked unit) has buff Bloodlust (Level 1)) Equal to False
                            Then - Actions
                                -------- Create dummy caster unit --------
                                Unit - Create 1 DummyBloodlust for (Owner of BL_Caster) at BL_Point facing Default building facing degrees
                                Set VariableSet BL_DummyUnit = (Last created unit)
                                Unit - Add a 3.00 second Generic expiration timer to (Last created unit)
                                Unit - Set level of ENHANCEMENT_BloodlustDummyCast  for BL_DummyUnit to BL_AbilityLevel
                                Unit - Order BL_DummyUnit to Orc Shaman - Bloodlust (Picked unit)
                            Else - Actions
            Else - Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
