                                Unit - Set level of ENHANCEMENT_BloodlustDummyCast  for BL_DummyUnit to BL_AbilityLevel
                                Unit - Order BL_DummyUnit to Orc Shaman - Bloodlust (Picked unit)
                                -------- CRIT --------
                                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                                    If - Conditions
                                        BL_AppliedLevel[Temp_Integer] Not equal to 3
                                    Then - Actions
                                        Unit Group - Add (Picked unit) to BL_CritGroup
                                        Set VariableSet BL_Crit[Temp_Integer] = 5
                                        Set VariableSet BL_AppliedLevel[Temp_Integer] = BL_AbilityLevel
                                        Set VariableSet Stats_Crit[Temp_Integer] = (Stats_Crit[Temp_Integer] + BL_Crit[Temp_Integer])
                                        -------- TURN ON Bloodlust Crit Loop --------
                                        Trigger - Turn on Bloodlust Crit Loop <gen>
                                    Else - Actions
                            Else - Actions
            Else - Actions
